  "loadCaseRules": "Copy the folder `installed` to a fresh skins directory, apply `ops` in order (paths relative to that directory; `from` relative to this folder), then verify `skin` (default sakura_tea@3) with the state (default empty) under the policy (test: test-root-1 trusted and test- kids accepted; release: no root trusted, test- kids refused). Ops: flip (XOR 0x01 at offset), truncate (to length), write (hex bytes; append when `append`), delete, move (rename to `to`), symlink (create a symbolic link at path pointing to target), copy (replace path with a vector file).",
